    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n2\n5 10\n3\n1 1 1\n3\n5 2 7",
        "output": "25 25\n5 7\n23 37",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : We are forced to choose i=1i = 1i=1 in the first and only operation, and XXX is calculated as 252525 which becomes our final element.\nTest Case 2 : To achieve the minimum,\n\nFirst choose i=1i = 1i=1, X=3X = 3X=3, AAA updated to [3,1][3, 1][3,1].\nAgain choose i=1i = 1i=1, X=5X = 5X=5, AAA updated to [5][5][5].\n\nTo achieve the maximum,\n\nFirst choose i=2i = 2i=2, X=3X = 3X=3, AAA updated to [1,3][1, 3][1,3].\nNext choose i=1i = 1i=1, X=7X = 7X=7, AAA updated to [7][7][7]."
